{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Are you ready to become Dr. Alb's Prodigy? Embark on an epic journey in a post-apocalyptic universe, where you must aid the Doctor in battling invaders, rescuing stranded characters, and uncovering the root of the looming danger.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727890/extras/049df79e5e8d4ef83d1d3f505119a4a9.avif?t=1756647085\" width=652 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combining retro visuals with cinematic lighting</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727890/extras/a9b2b9e8e556d2199a6e6c75c3cb1b93.poster.avif?t=1756647085\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727890/extras/a9b2b9e8e556d2199a6e6c75c3cb1b93.webm?t=1756647085\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727890/extras/a9b2b9e8e556d2199a6e6c75c3cb1b93.mp4?t=1756647085\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Pixel graphics set within a 3D environment featuring cool lighting and impressive visual effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Roguelike elements and procedural generation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727890/extras/d24f7469cbe1a99b8eed99d332526279.poster.avif?t=1756647085\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727890/extras/d24f7469cbe1a99b8eed99d332526279.webm?t=1756647085\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727890/extras/d24f7469cbe1a99b8eed99d332526279.mp4?t=1756647085\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Embark on unique roguelike runs featuring randomized levels and elements, as you enhance your character with unique loot and abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multi-layered combat system</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727890/extras/a4601e0fd3da3747932b05cb3cca314a.poster.avif?t=1756647085\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727890/extras/a4601e0fd3da3747932b05cb3cca314a.webm?t=1756647085\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727890/extras/a4601e0fd3da3747932b05cb3cca314a.mp4?t=1756647085\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>The combat system blends turn-based and real-time mechanics, depending on enemy encounters and your damage capabilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Quests and intriguing characters to meet</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727890/extras/76ca99c3151c6333cf8bc013a12fa7f1.poster.avif?t=1756647085\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727890/extras/76ca99c3151c6333cf8bc013a12fa7f1.webm?t=1756647085\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727890/extras/76ca99c3151c6333cf8bc013a12fa7f1.mp4?t=1756647085\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>You'll engage with diverse NPCs and have the opportunity to undertake various side missions.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2727890?t=1756647085","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2727890?t=1756647085","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727890/2e2ba62d9369434b7bdc3253c64754eb69e02f7a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756647085","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727890/2e2ba62d9369434b7bdc3253c64754eb69e02f7a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756647085","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Are you ready to become Dr. Alb's Prodigy? Embark on an epic journey in a post-apocalyptic universe, where you must aid the Doctor in battling invaders, rescuing stranded characters, and uncovering the root of the looming danger.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727890/extras/049df79e5e8d4ef83d1d3f505119a4a9.avif?t=1756647085\" width=652 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combining retro visuals with cinematic lighting</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727890/extras/a9b2b9e8e556d2199a6e6c75c3cb1b93.poster.avif?t=1756647085\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727890/extras/a9b2b9e8e556d2199a6e6c75c3cb1b93.webm?t=1756647085\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/